# Skill: DaprRuntime
Description: Configure Dapr building blocks for distributed runtime.
Tool: DaprAgent.full_setup(target="k8s")
Purpose: Abstract infrastructure (pubsub, state, cron, secrets, invoke) behind Dapr HTTP API.
Usage: POST /api/dapr/full-setup
Components: pubsub.kafka (task-pubsub), state.postgresql (task-statestore), bindings.cron (reminder-cron), secretstores.kubernetes, secretstores.local.file.
Fallback: In-memory state, direct HTTP, env vars when Dapr sidecar unavailable.
